lapis: Mesa 26.3.1's gallium panfrost (panthor backend; G615 / v11 is in
26.x, not in 25.0) on iOS over the kernel's LapisGPU, without a GL frontend
(OSMesa left Mesa in 25.1): tools/mesa/lapis-drm as libdrm, a new gallium
target "lapis" (liblapis_gallium: the panfrost screen + a self-test).
- src/util/u_endian.h: no <endian.h> on Darwin (as hakios's darwin-sdk.patch,
  MIT, Copyright (c) 2025-2026 the HakiOS authors).
- meson.build: on Darwin with panfrost, dep_libdrm is the lapis-drm stand-in.
- panthor_kmod.c, pan_bo.c: mmap()/munmap() on the device go to
  lapis_drm_mmap()/lapis_drm_munmap() (LapisGPU client memory).
- src/gallium/targets/lapis: the library and its test.

